  filters.js reuses smooth.js and enhance_details.cc's direction for the whole-part filters; its
  two length-based filters (inflate, scale) size themselves from the part's bounding box, which is
  our own choice, not Blender's.

Brush kernels added later (brushes/set-a.js) name their own sources in their file headers.

presets.json is a measurement of Blender 5.2.1's Essentials brush library
(datafiles/assets/brushes/essentials_brushes-mesh_sculpt.blend), dumped headless.
scripts/blender-ref.py records golden strokes from the same build for the parity tests.

